    <string name="lan_pair">Pair with Velivo on Windows</string>
    <string name="lan_pair_help">For 3 minutes this phone (“%1$s”) waits for pairing. Keep this window open and the screen on. If another computer with Velivo is on the network, it will ask about pairing too – click “No” there. On the computer open Velivo → Settings → real-time sync (LAN) → “Pair a device on the network…”. Both devices must be on the same Wi-Fi network. Note: pairing changes the sync key on the computer – other computers must be paired again. With several computers, use “Save recovery file…” on the computer instead and load it on the phone.</string>
